  <entry>
    <title>鹊踏枝</title>
    <link href="https://yesandnoandperhaps.cn/posts/36cac306.html"/>
    <id>https://yesandnoandperhaps.cn/posts/36cac306.html</id>
    <published>2025-08-13T13:00:00.000Z</published>
    <updated>2025-08-13T13:09:42.496Z</updated>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<link rel="stylesheet" class="aplayer-secondary-style-marker" href="/css/APlayer.min.css"><script src="/js/APlayer.min.js" class="aplayer-secondary-script-marker"></script><script>var meting_api='https://api.injahow.cn/meting/?server=:server&type=:type&id=:id&r=:r'</script><script class="meting-secondary-script-marker" src="/js/Meting.min.js"></script><p>  ​隔雾啼声声几缕。瓦上檐前，燕子空飞渡。尽日烟云低锁暮，斜阳绊在凭栏处。<br>  此际人间秋又误。片恨高天，落寞浑如许。一树愁痕千树雨，无关风月无关苦。</p>]]></content>
    
    
    <summary type="html">​隔雾啼声声几缕。瓦上檐前，燕子空飞渡。尽日烟云低锁暮，斜阳绊在凭栏处。 此际人间秋又误。片恨高天，落寞浑如许。一树愁痕千树雨，无关风月无关苦。
</summary>
    
    
    
