  <entry>
    <title>登楼</title>
    <link href="https://yesandnoandperhaps.cn/posts/102e1d7a.html"/>
    <id>https://yesandnoandperhaps.cn/posts/102e1d7a.html</id>
    <published>2025-08-12T08:25:00.000Z</published>
    <updated>2025-08-12T08:42:31.958Z</updated>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<link rel="stylesheet" class="aplayer-secondary-style-marker" href="/css/APlayer.min.css"><script src="/js/APlayer.min.js" class="aplayer-secondary-script-marker"></script><script>var meting_api='https://api.injahow.cn/meting/?server=:server&type=:type&id=:id&r=:r'</script><script class="meting-secondary-script-marker" src="/js/Meting.min.js"></script><p>  破碎西风入夜澄，高楼万仞几回登。<br>  江河水尽人千里，日月天隔我一层。<br>  济世从来悲转海，成章无以报昏灯。<br>  平生意志挥难满，寂寞栏杆任自凭。</p>]]></content>
    
    
    <summary type="html">破碎西风入夜澄，高楼万仞几回登。江河水尽人千里，日月天隔我一层。济世从来悲转海，成章无以报昏灯。平生意志挥难满，寂寞栏杆任自凭。</summary>
    
    
    
