  <entry>
    <title>雨兴</title>
    <link href="https://yesandnoandperhaps.cn/posts/8b51c5d2.html"/>
    <id>https://yesandnoandperhaps.cn/posts/8b51c5d2.html</id>
    <published>2025-08-11T15:00:00.000Z</published>
    <updated>2025-08-11T15:42:39.344Z</updated>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<link rel="stylesheet" class="aplayer-secondary-style-marker" href="/css/APlayer.min.css"><script src="/js/APlayer.min.js" class="aplayer-secondary-script-marker"></script><script>var meting_api='https://api.injahow.cn/meting/?server=:server&type=:type&id=:id&r=:r'</script><script class="meting-secondary-script-marker" src="/js/Meting.min.js"></script><p>  ​半面忧愁半面天，乌云暗淡闭人间。<br>  无极日月淹尘海，咫尺乡关隔素烟。<br>  阻雨渔帆东河水，塌山樵隐北风肩。<br>  年来辗转萧条尽，过眼浮沉任自然。</p>]]></content>
    
    
    <summary type="html">​半面忧愁半面天，乌云暗淡闭人间。无极日月淹尘海，咫尺乡关隔素烟。阻雨渔帆东河水，塌山樵隐北风肩。年来辗转萧条尽，过眼浮沉任自然。</summary>
    
    
    
