  <entry>
    <title>立秋于归途有寄</title>
    <link href="https://yesandnoandperhaps.cn/posts/41a95008.html"/>
    <id>https://yesandnoandperhaps.cn/posts/41a95008.html</id>
    <published>2025-08-10T13:43:21.000Z</published>
    <updated>2025-08-10T13:51:05.180Z</updated>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<link rel="stylesheet" class="aplayer-secondary-style-marker" href="/css/APlayer.min.css"><script src="/js/APlayer.min.js" class="aplayer-secondary-script-marker"></script><script>var meting_api='https://api.injahow.cn/meting/?server=:server&type=:type&id=:id&r=:r'</script><script class="meting-secondary-script-marker" src="/js/Meting.min.js"></script><p>  神仙倦暑到秋临，一揽天光破久阴。<br>  万里云波铺浩渺，千边海日出深沉。<br>  留连宠辱迟风物，陷溺兴亡误好今。<br>  莽莽青山移正远，独垂白首对空吟。</p>]]></content>
    
    
    <summary type="html">神仙倦暑到秋临，一揽天光破久阴。万里云波铺浩渺，千边海日出深沉。</summary>
    
    
    
