    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<link rel="stylesheet" class="aplayer-secondary-style-marker" href="/css/APlayer.min.css"><script src="/js/APlayer.min.js" class="aplayer-secondary-script-marker"></script><script>var meting_api='https://api.injahow.cn/meting/?server=:server&type=:type&id=:id&r=:r'</script><script class="meting-secondary-script-marker" src="/js/Meting.min.js"></script><p>  半点愁心难作赋，夜深枯望伫前门。<br>  重云抱月清光窄，病叶融灯一树昏。<br>  竟苦霜毫无别意，犹怜松墨有余温。<br>  诗情再起春归处，许向青梢系旧魂。</p>]]></content>
    
    
    <summary type="html">半点愁心难作赋，夜深枯望伫前门。重云抱月清光窄，病叶融灯一树昏。</summary>
    
    
    
